        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(i) Not more than once during each Temporary Transfer such an Employee may, upon at least three (3) working days notice to the Company, change his or her election and accept the per diem allowance payable under Paragraph 4(c)(1) or change to the lodging option as the case may be. However, in no case may an Employee elect the per diem allowance payable under Paragraph 4(c)(1) for the day scheduled for departure to return to his or her Base Location (or Hiring Location, if applicable) unless he or she had received such an allowance for the day preceding the scheduled date of departure.",
            "block_bbox": [
